@10800000 = ~Install Arsenal - Fighter kit~ //Arsenal: Install Kit Component
@10800001 = ~arsenal~ //Arsenal: Lower Case Kit Name
@10800002 = ~Arsenal~ //Arsenal: Mixed Case Kit Name
@10800003 = ~ARSENAL: Some marksman depend on pure skill but in the league of ingenuity the Arsenal is a titan of <PRO_HISHER> squad. Arsenals focus on the utilisation of specially built devices called Cartridges which empower their ammunition at a price.

Advantages:
– +1 bonus to hit and damage rolls with any missile weapon.
– May use the Check Cartridge ability at will, starting at level 1.

CHECK CARTRIDGE: When this ability is activated, the Arsenal lists off the active cartridges.

– May use the Clear Cartridge ability at will, starting at level 1.

CLEAR CARTRIDGE: When this ability is activated, the Arsenal removes all cartridges.

– May use the Needle Cartridge ability at will, starting at level 1.

NEEDLE CARTRIDGE: All successful ranged attacks have the following effects beside normal damage, according to the level of the Arsenal:
 1st level: Enemies have a -1 penalty to hit for 1 round.
 5th level: Enemies have a -2 penalty to hit for 1 round.
 9th level: Enemies have a -2 penalty to hit for 2 rounds.
 13th level: Enemies have a -3 penalty to hit for 2 rounds.

While this cartridge is loaded, the Arsenal gains a -4 speed penalty with missile weapons. This penalty stacks with other cartridge penalties loaded.

– May use the Flechette Cartridge ability at will, starting at level 5.

FLECHETTE CARTRIDGE: All successful ranged attacks have the following effects beside normal damage, according to the level of the Arsenal:
 4th level: 1d2 slashing damage to all enemies within a 7.5ft. radius.
 8th level: 1d4 slashing damage to all enemies within a 7.5ft. radius.
 12th level: 1d4 slashing damage to all enemies within a 15ft. radius.
 16th level: 1d6 slashing damage to all enemies within a 15ft. radius.

While this cartridge is loaded, the Arsenal gains a -6 penalty to damage with missile weapons. This penalty stacks with other cartridge penalties loaded.

– May use the Heavy Cartridge ability at will, starting at level 7th level.

HEAVY CARTRIDGE: All successful ranged attacks have the following effects beside normal damage, according to the level of the Arsenal:
 7th level: 10% chance to stun for 1 second.
 11th level: 20% chance to stun for 1 second.
 15th level: 20% chance to stun for 2 seconds.
 19th level: 35% chance to stun for 2 seconds.

While this cartridge is loaded, the Arsenal gains a -4 penalty to hit with missile weapons. This penalty stacks with other cartridge penalties loaded.

Disadvantages:
– May not exceed High Mastery (four slots) in any ranged weapons.
– May not exceed Proficiency (one slots) in any melee weapons or melee weapon styles.~ //Arsenal: Kit Description - Vanilla
